    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22577" root="شغل" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَغْلَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Reaped grain</i> or <i>wheat, collected together,
in the place where it is trodden out;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْدَرٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُدْسٌ</span> (IAar, O, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَمَةٌ</span>; (IAar, O;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَغَلَةٌ</span></b> : (IAth, TA:) pl. [or coll. gen. n.]
of the former ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَغْلٌ</span></b> , (O, K, TA, [in the CK,
erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُغَلٌ</span>,]) like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرٌ</span> is of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرَةٌ</span>. (O,
TA.)

